{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10640010","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10640010","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1064001001:0":{"text":"うっ……","source_cn":"唔……<key:dialog64>","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x16ADADC6BAFAD984","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1064001002:1":{"text":"ライオス！やっと起きた！","source_cn":"莱欧斯！你终于醒了！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x629D551451BE71D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1064001003:1":{"text":"マルシル、チルチャック、セン……あれ？センシは？","source_cn":"玛露西尔、齐尔查克、森……呃？森西呢？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xAEC5B9402B29287F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1064001004:1":{"text":"転移酔い。近くで休んでるよ。","source_cn":"森西晕传送，正在一旁休息。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xCEC233DF66F36C01","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1064001005:1":{"text":"私たち、迷宮から外に飛ばされちゃったみたい。","source_cn":"我们似乎在迷宫里被传送出来了。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x270D75194005D00D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1064001006:1":{"text":"ええと、ここは……？","source_cn":"所以，这里是……？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x979634A0BCCB8BF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1064001007:1":{"text":"初めまして、私はメイメイと申します。ここはエスペリアですよ。","source_cn":"你好，我是漫漫。这里是伊索米亚。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xF94679DB350208ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1064001008:1":{"text":"なっ、喋るネズミの魔物！？","source_cn":"等等——会说话的仓鼠魔物？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xAA7E78EFD812A862","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1064001009:1":{"text":"この子たちは使い魔！","source_cn":"……他们是使魔啦！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xBE56B90F85A33204","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1064001010:1":{"text":"ロンロンとメイメイは、強いメイジ――つまり私たちのところで言う魔術師だけが生み出せる使い魔なんだって。","source_cn":"满满和漫漫是强大的魔法师——也就是我们那里被称为魔术师...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1064001011:1":{"text":"その通りです！ロンロンたちのマスターは、エスペリア最強のメイジ、マーリン様なんですよ！","source_cn":"玛露西尔小姐说得没错！我们的主人正是伊索米亚最强大的魔...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1064001012:1":{"text":"初めて聞く名前だな……","source_cn":"完全没听说过……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xC87A5BDEF55E37DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1064001013:1":{"text":"わし……おえっ……","source_cn":"老……呕……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x9E1B6F42FF0573C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1064001014:1":{"text":"センシさん、具合がかなり悪いようですね。一度、神秘屋に戻って治療しましょう。","source_cn":"这位森西先生看起来状态不是很好，先跟我们回神秘屋治疗一下吧。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x7461B5B521238BED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1064001015:1":{"text":"治療できるの？ありがとう！","source_cn":"有办法治疗吗？那就拜托你们了。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x25E57CBBDC3AF367","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1064001016:0":{"text":"え、ちょっと、まだどういう状況か説明してもらってな――おーい！","source_cn":"等等，还是没有人跟我解释清楚状况啊！别走啊——","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x3D8528EFF16B50B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:30:1064001017:1":{"text":"メイメイとロンロンはマルシルたちを連れて神秘屋へ戻った……","source_cn":"漫漫和满满带着玛露西尔一行人返回了神秘屋……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xCC56AC51449DC902","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1064001018:1":{"text":"マスター！手伝ってください、マスター！","source_cn":"梅林，梅林——快来帮帮忙！","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x81254A07E3F8CCD2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1064001019:1":{"text":"こちらのセンシさんが、酷いテレポート酔いを起こしてるんです。","source_cn":"这位森西先生晕传送晕得很厉害！","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x88CFD2626653834F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1064001020:1":{"text":"センシはドワーフで、転移酔いしやすい体質なの……","source_cn":"森西是矮人，是很容易晕传送的体质……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x19D3E1BC3580AF05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1064001021:1":{"text":"あ、まずは自己紹介しなきゃね。初めまして、マーリン<male>さん</male><female>さん</female>。私はマルシル、あなたと同じ魔術師だよ。","source_cn":"啊，忘记自我介绍了。梅林<male>先生</male>...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:37:1064001021":{"text":"あ、まずは自己紹介しなきゃね。初めまして、マーリン<male>さん</male><female>さん</female>。私はマルシル、あなたと同じ魔術師だよ。","source_cn":"啊，忘记自我介绍了。梅林<male>先生</male><female>女士</female>，我是玛露西尔，也是一名魔法师。","status":"matched_luae_markup","hash_xxh64":"0xE994AB8C6FA2B556","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1064001022:1":{"text":"私にも治療を手伝わせて。","source_cn":"我也来一起帮忙吧！","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xC22896E2E85DCB9F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1064001023:1":{"text":"や、やめろ……うぉえっ……","source_cn":"不……要……呃……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x152D35E755171AAF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:42:1064001023":{"text":"や、やめろ……うぉえっ……","source_cn":"不……要……呃……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x152D35E755171AAF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:43:1064001024:1":{"text":"あなたたちの治療で、センシは少し回復したようだ。","source_cn":"","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:44:1064001025:0":{"text":"ライオス、マルシル、チルチャックとセンシは、ロンロンとメイメイの熱心な説明（もとい自慢話）を聞いて、あなたの経歴と実力を理解した。","source_cn":"莱欧斯、玛露西尔、齐尔查克和森西也在满满和漫漫的热情说...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:45:1064001026:0":{"text":"そして、あなたも、彼らが別の次元からやってきた冒険者であることを知った。彼らは迷宮の中を探索し、炎竜（レッドドラゴン）に食べられた仲間のファリンを探していた――","source_cn":"你也得知了他们是来自于另一个世界的冒险者。他们在迷宫中...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:46:1064001027:1":{"text":"そして無事にファリンを「生き返らせた」が、迷宮の主に遭遇してしまい、またもやファリンと離ればなれになってしまったらしい。","source_cn":"","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:47:1064001028:1":{"text":"その後、変化する迷宮の中で道に迷った彼らは、初めて目にする魔物と遭遇した。","source_cn":"","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:48:1064001029:1":{"text":"その魔物との戦闘で、四人とも気を失ってしまい、目を覚ましたらエスペリアにいたそうだ。","source_cn":"","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1064001030:1":{"text":"あわわ…すごく大変な冒険だったんですね……","source_cn":"好曲折的冒险！满满听着都觉得辛苦……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x8417DFDDC0F9EEB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1064001031:0":{"text":"確かに大変だったけど、おかげで、色んな魔物の味を知れたよ。","source_cn":"是有点辛苦了，但也品尝到了很多不同风味的魔物。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x5D2C61DDA5AC4B32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1064001032:1":{"text":"……魔物の味？ま、まさか、ロンロンを食べるとか言わないですよね！？","source_cn":"……吃魔物？！呜哇，你们不会、不会吃满满吧？！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xB3FB8FB1D3861FDA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1064001033:0":{"text":"グーーー","source_cn":"咕——","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x50227C51D4BBA586","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1064001034:0":{"text":"ライオス！怖がらせちゃだめでしょ！あと、お腹の音がうるさい！","source_cn":"莱欧斯！不要吓人啦！还有，你的肚子叫得太大声了——","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xD54356F65584482B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:58:1064001035:1":{"text":"大丈夫だからね、ロンロン！魔物なら何でも食べるわけじゃないの。ちゃんと相手を選んでるから。","source_cn":"别担心，满满！我们可不是什么魔物都吃的，我们会挑选对象的。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x9D56E917C8DD67A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:60:1064001036:1":{"text":"それ、フォローになってるのか？","source_cn":"……那算是圆场吗？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xB02411C27F8E8BB7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:62:1064001037:0":{"text":"ごほっ……わ、若者に、ひもじい思いをさせるわけには……","source_cn":"咳咳，不能……让年轻人饿肚子……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x4893B25613E6ED0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:65:1064001038:1":{"text":"お待たせしました！マーリン様に言われて、食事を用意しましたよ。これを食べて、ゆっくり休んでくださいね。","source_cn":"久等了！根据梅林大人的吩咐我准备了食物，请好好享用并休息吧。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xB5AB3A98374C857F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:65::2":{"text":"月桂冠の酒場セット","source_cn":"月桂酒馆套餐","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDCCAD1C9B43A1A2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:66:1064001039:1":{"text":"特製手羽揚げの葱人参ソース添えに、オランシアベリーエール。当店のおすすめセットです！","source_cn":"请品尝我们月桂酒馆的招牌套餐吧！秘制炸鸡翅配特色葱萝酱...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:68:1064001040:0":{"text":"手羽揚げ！？まともな食材！うぅ……","source_cn":"鸡翅？！好正常的食材，呜呜——","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xCFE0FA73A293D236","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:70:1064001041:1":{"text":"うれしい！やっと魔物以外の食事にありつける！","source_cn":"太好了！终于能吃到魔物以外的食物了！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xC80B2DA8BAB8FA7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:72:1064001042:1":{"text":"おお、このエール、すごくいい香りだな……","source_cn":"唔，这个啤酒闻起来好香——","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x1EBB48E8CD35B18F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:73:1064001043:1":{"text":"どれどれ、味は――","source_cn":"我来尝一尝——","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x808E7D41BBD78A0B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:75:1064001044:1":{"text":"くぅー！きめ細かい泡、濃厚で滑らかな喉越し！果実とホップの香りのバランスが絶妙だ！","source_cn":"嗝——上层泡沫细腻，酒体醇厚顺滑！果味和麦芽醇香完美平衡！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x95A23084BFDF2989","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:77:1064001045:1":{"text":"むむ！これは見事だな。心なしか具合も良くなった気がするぞ。","source_cn":"呼！老夫也觉得不错，似乎觉得连眩晕感都好了不少。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x38A1AAD0CA0E99C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:79:1064001046:1":{"text":"うまい！外はパリパリで、中はすごくジューシーだ……バジリスクの食感に似ているな。","source_cn":"美味！外皮酥脆，内里多汁……和蛇尾鸡的口感有一些相似呢。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x778E24B8E095FF3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:81:1064001047:1":{"text":"逆でしょ逆！こっちが本物の鶏肉なんだから！","source_cn":"本末倒置了！这才是纯正的鸡肉啊！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x8BDABBD93D90ACBC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:83:1064001048:1":{"text":"バジリスクと言えば……ここからどうやって迷宮に戻ればいいんだ？","source_cn":"……说到蛇尾鸡，我们要怎么回迷宫啊？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x9FEB26E5054106B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:84:1064001049:0":{"text":"……分からない。","source_cn":"我也不知道。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x7E12E4FA1E8840D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:85:1064001050:0":{"text":"そもそも、どうやってここへ来たのかも分からないし。","source_cn":"我们怎么过来的都没有搞清楚……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x6AAFA5C6468DB455","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:86:1064001051:0":{"text":"たしか、魔物と戦って、気を失ったんだよな？","source_cn":"我们晕过去之前是跟一个魔物战斗吧？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xE7A46C9C1585E356","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:87:1064001051":{"text":"たしか、魔物と戦って、気を失ったんだよな？","source_cn":"我们晕过去之前是跟一个魔物战斗吧？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xE7A46C9C1585E356","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:88:1064001052:1":{"text":"誰も見たことのない魔物だったね。","source_cn":"我们没有一个人见过或者听说过。","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x7EEE69B41AFDB382","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:89:1064001052":{"text":"誰も見たことのない魔物だったね。","source_cn":"我们没有一个人见过或者听说过。","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x7EEE69B41AFDB382","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:90:1064001053:1":{"text":"ええと……タコのような姿をしていて、八本の手足で袋状の核みたいなものを守ってたな。","source_cn":"唔……那个魔物有着类似章鱼的构造，有八个腕足保护着囊状核心。","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xBF99E6677A703722","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:91:1064001054:1":{"text":"あとは、頭に目がたくさんついてて……体は濃い紫で、星の光みたいな斑点があったな。","source_cn":"头上有着好几只深紫色的眼睛，并且带着星光状的斑点。","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xE61DB7BC0AE59B2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:92:1064001055:1":{"text":"あんな短時間で、よくそこまで観察できたな……","source_cn":"亏你能在短时间内观察这么细……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xE57DE4928E623653","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:95:1064001056:1":{"text":"マスター……あなたの持っている魔法書の中で、似たような魔物を見た気がします。","source_cn":"梅林……我好像在你珍藏的魔法书里有见到过这样的魔物。","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x2E3A4FE6854BAA7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:97:1064001057:1":{"text":"本当に？マーリン<male>さん</male><female>さん</female>、よかったら、その本を見せてくれない？","source_cn":"咦？真的吗？梅林<male>先生</male><fem...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:98:1064001057":{"text":"本当に？マーリン<male>さん</male><female>さん</female>、よかったら、その本を見せてくれない？","source_cn":"咦？真的吗？梅林<male>先生</male><female>女士</female>，请问那本书在哪里？","status":"matched_luae_markup","hash_xxh64":"0xCF79555AABB8B8CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:99:1064001058:1":{"text":"そんな……なんとかして戻る方法を探さないと、ファリンが……","source_cn":"那怎么办？我们得想办法回去，毕竟法琳现在……","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x7EECBF85C5DCE3AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:100:1064001059:1":{"text":"大丈夫ですよ、マルシルさん。その本なら、きっと神秘屋のどこかにあるはずです。マスターと一緒に探してみますから！","source_cn":"玛露西尔，先别着急。那本书应该就在神秘屋里，我和主人去...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:101:1064001060:1":{"text":"私も手伝う！私は古代魔術を研究してるから、何か役に立てるかも！","source_cn":"我也来帮忙！我研究的是古代魔法，或许能派上用场！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x5F222DDAAA607166","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:102:1064001061:1":{"text":"それじゃあ、一緒に探しましょう！","source_cn":"那就一起吧！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xC34241D6F6F70CD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:98:0:1":{"text":"実は記憶喪失で……","source_cn":"我失忆了……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDC7F2B5C61E6E02A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"実は記憶喪失で……","female":"実は記憶喪失で……","variant_male_record_index":"60380","variant_female_record_index":"60381","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:98:1:2":{"text":"まったく覚えてないんだ。","source_cn":"完全没有印象","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x796DB0AE6996EB57","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"まったく覚えてないんだ。","female":"まったく覚えてないの。","variant_male_record_index":"60382","variant_female_record_index":"60383","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:89:0:1":{"text":"何か特徴は？","source_cn":"那有什么特征吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3194AD2293B2B422","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"何か特徴は？","female":"何か特徴は？","variant_male_record_index":"60378","variant_female_record_index":"60379","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:87:0:1":{"text":"なんの魔物だ？","source_cn":"那个魔物叫什么？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x74980A97B44C3DAC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"なんの魔物だ？","female":"なんの魔物なの？","variant_male_record_index":"60376","variant_female_record_index":"60377","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:42:0:1":{"text":"（マルシルと一緒にセンシの治療をする）","source_cn":"（和玛露西尔一起治疗森西）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x52C2FB89C93F8213","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"（マルシルと一緒にセンシの治療をする）","female":"（マルシルと一緒にセンシの治療をする）","variant_male_record_index":"60374","variant_female_record_index":"60375","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"